---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Bail Services | Rajendra Criminal Law Firm" description="General information on bail applications in Chennai." canonical="https://criminaladvocate.in/bail-services/">
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <img src="/images/bail-lawyers.webp" alt="Bail lawyers in Chennai" class="w-full max-w-md mb-8 rounded-sm" />
    <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl text-navy mb-6">Bail Services</h1>
    <div class="prose text-ink/90 leading-relaxed">
      <p>Bail is a procedural right that allows an accused person to remain free pending trial, subject to conditions. This page provides general information only and does not constitute legal advice.</p>
      <p>Applications may be filed before the Magistrate, Sessions Court, or the Madras High Court.</p>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-8 text-sm"><a href="/practice/bail" class="text-navy hover:text-crimson">Bail Practice Area</a> · <a href="/contact" class="text-navy hover:text-crimson">Contact</a></p>
  </article>
</Layout>
